rooms_desc ({"This is the grand foyer of Alia's house.  You glance aroundin awe at the marble floors, picturesque windows and at thealluring cathedral ceiling.  Despite its obvious grandeur,you feel extremely welcome and comfortable here!","The first thing you notice here is the grand piano.  Next to thepiano is an antique bookshelf filled with music.  At the far sideof the room, against the wall is a huge stereo system and a varietyof cd's in the rack on top of the stereo.  A huge bay window facesthe beautiful backyard and on the window sill are countless greenplants.  There is a huge fluffy couch against the other wall.  Thisrooms seems perfect for listening to music and relaxing!","You have just stepped outside through a set of sliding glass doors.It is now easy to see the beautiful mountain the house is situatedupon.  The clear blue sky and white snow capped peak add even moreto the majestic air this mountain portrays.  There are a few scarceski trails near the top and a lake sparkling from the sun at thebase.  Resting against the side of the house are a set of skis andpoles.  What good would a mountain like this be without them!","You have just walked over a small footbridge.  Running under it is a beautiful babbling brook slowly running down the lower partof the mountain.  There are trees all around with a nice grassyopen meadow in the middle.  This looks like a very secluded place,perfect to get away to when you need peace and quiet.    ","This seems to be an informal living room.  There is a huge fluffycouch and some chairs surrounding an exquisite oak coffee table.Opposite the couch, against the wall is a huge television with aVcr.  There are many leafy plants by the windows and in a few ofthe corners in the room.  On the walls are a variety of picturesand photos.  This room seems to be attatched to the game roomfurther to the south, perfect just to relax in or entertain!","This is obvious a room to have fun in!  There is a large stockedbar at the far end, with a huge neon Bud Dry sign behind it anda tap to the side.  There is a Seaberg 200 jukebox against onewall, a pinball machine and a few slot machines at the oppositeside of the room, and a bumper pool table in the middle.  Alarge number of Anheiser-Busch signs surround the room, includingmirrors, neon clocks, and a light up Spud Mackenzie dog.  You                 stand in Awe! :)","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is Alia's study.  Towards the back of the room is a huge oakdesk, with bookshelves lining the walls behind.  There seems tobe as many books in this room as would be in any impressive library.Resting on the desk, are numerous pictures.  The chair behind thedesk is made of soft comfortable leather.  This seems to be avery quiet and pleasant place to work in.  ","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",})
